:: Start

<style>
.name-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}
</style>
main character's name

<div class="name-row">
    <label>First Name:</label>
    <<textbox "$FName" "Alex">>

    <label>Last Name:</label>
    <<textbox "$LName" "Willson">>
</div>


<<link "New Game" "intro">><</link>>

:: intro
The view out the truck window is changing, getting more and more populated with neat lawns infront of generic homes and store fronts one after the other. a stark contrast from the familiar farm land you grew up with. on top of the packed bag beside you rests a letter youve already opened and read multiple time.
<<link "read the letter" "letter">>
<<timeAdvance "minute" 20>>
<</link>>

:: letter

you open the letter.
<span style="color: rgb(11, 29, 14);display:block;background-color:rgba(247, 247, 247, 0.93);padding:1em;width:80%;margin: 1em auto;">
<center>''University of Oakland''</center>
From:
 Dean Fogekirk
 Office of Admissions
 University of Oakland

To:
 $FName $LName

Dear Mr. $LName,

On behalf of the University of Oakland, I am pleased to inform you that you have been accepted for admission to our undergraduate program for the upcoming academic year.

After careful review of your application and academic record, the Admissions Committee determined that you demonstrated exceptional potential, dedication, and promise. We believe you will make a valuable contribution to our campus community and thrive in the opportunities available here.

In recognition of your achievements, the University is also pleased to award you a ''Full Academic Scholarship''. This scholarship will cover the full cost of tuition and mandatory university fees for the duration of your studies, subject to the University's standard academic standing requirements.

We congratulate you on this accomplishment and look forward to welcoming you to our campus. Additional information regarding enrollment, housing, orientation, and course registration will be provided in the enclosed materials.

We wish you continued success and look forward to seeing you on campus.

Sincerely,

 Dean Fogekirk
 Dean of Admissions
 University of Oakland

</span>

<<link "put it away" "drive">>
<<timeAdvance "minute" 20>>
<</link>>

:: drive
<<dialog "uncle">>
"you doin alright back there big man?"<</dialog>>
<<name "uncle">> asks from the driver seat.
<<dialog "uncle">>
"look atcha who wouldve thunk they'd pay some one who ate crayons till he was 8 to go to college."
"full scholarship huh? don't know nobody from back in town who got one o those but good for you kid. your ma wouldve been proud"<</dialog>>
he taps his fingers on the wheel keeping his eyes on the road.
<<dialog "uncle">>"anywho aint gotta bother about them student loans, think that's fair trade for going 2 states away for college."<</dialog>>
<<link "continue" "arrival">>
<<timeSet {minute:0, hour:7, date:8}>>
<</link>>

:: arrival

you reach the university. it doesn't quite meassure up to what was in the brochure. looks mid.

<span>is this really an internationl university ? </span>

<<link "look around" "campus">>
<</link>>

:: campus
<<sceneImage "assets/campus.png">>
the campus looks small but functioning.

[[goto cafeteria|cafeteria]]
[[goto library|library]]
[[go to the frontdesk|"front desk"]]

:: library
<<sceneImage "assets/library.png">>
/% <<if $studentID is false>> %/
  <<name "librarian">> sits at the desk supervising the establishment.
  <<characters "librarian">>
  <<dialog "librarian">>"quiet please."<</dialog>>
  <<link "look for books" "shelves">><</link>>
  <<link "use the computer" "computer">><</link>>
  <<link "study" "library study">>
    <<set $hunger += 10>>
  <</link>>
/% <<else>>
you need your student ID to enter the library.
<</if>> %/
<<link "campus" "campus">>
<</link>>

:: shelves
you walk through the shelevs of books
nothing seems particularly worth reading at the moment.
<<link "front desk" "library">><</link>>

:: computer
you spend some time browsing the web.
there isn't much to do here
<<link "front desk" "library">><</link>>

:: library study
<<sceneImage "assets/study.png">>
you spend some hours studying in the library.
<<link "front desk" "library">><</link>>

